---
layout: layouts/base.njk
lang: en
title: Outdoor Furniture in Egypt - All Products
description: Browse Nestica outdoor furniture, umbrellas, swings, dining sets, rattan and outdoor rope products, with filters by category, space and price.
permalink: /en/products/
---
<section class="catalog-hero compact-hero"><div class="container text-center"><span class="section-kicker">Nestica Collection</span><h1>All Outdoor Furniture Products</h1><p>Filter by category, space or price and compare designs before asking for details.</p></div></section>
<section class="container catalog-section"><div class="catalog-toolbar"><div class="catalog-search"><i class="bi bi-search"></i><input type="search" id="productSearchInput" class="form-control" placeholder="Search by product name or material..." aria-label="Search products"></div><select id="categoryFilter" class="form-select" aria-label="Category filter"><option value="">All Categories</option>{% for category in categories %}<option value="{{ category.id }}">{{ category.name_en }}</option>{% endfor %}</select><select id="spaceFilter" class="form-select" aria-label="Space filter"><option value="">All Spaces</option>{% for space in spaces %}<option value="{{ space.slug }}">{{ space.name_en }}</option>{% endfor %}</select><select id="priceFilter" class="form-select" aria-label="Price filter"><option value="">All Prices</option><option value="0-10000">Below 10,000 EGP</option><option value="10000-20000">10,000 - 20,000 EGP</option><option value="20000-40000">20,000 - 40,000 EGP</option><option value="40000+">Above 40,000 EGP</option></select><select id="sortProducts" class="form-select" aria-label="Sort products"><option value="default">Default Order</option><option value="price-asc">Price: Low to High</option><option value="price-desc">Price: High to Low</option><option value="name">Name</option></select><button id="resetFilters" class="btn btn-outline-dark" type="button"><i class="bi bi-arrow-counterclockwise"></i> Reset</button></div><div class="catalog-results-bar"><p><strong id="visibleProductsCount">0</strong> matching products</p><a href="https://wa.me/{{ settings.whatsapp | replace('+','') }}?text={{ 'I need help choosing the right outdoor furniture' | urlencode }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="trackWhatsappLead('catalog_help_en')"><i class="bi bi-whatsapp"></i> Need help choosing?</a></div><div class="row g-4" id="productsGrid">{% for product in products %}{% if product.is_active != false %}<div class="col-xl-3 col-lg-4 col-md-6 product-list-item" data-original-order="{{ loop.index }}">{% include "components/product-card.njk" %}</div>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div><div class="text-center mt-5"><button id="loadMoreProducts" class="btn btn-dark rounded-pill px-5" type="button">Load More Products</button></div><div class="empty-products d-none" id="noProductsFound"><i class="bi bi-search"></i><h2>No Matching Products</h2><p>Change the filters or send your space details on WhatsApp.</p></div></section>
